                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\mathcal{H}, v, \pi: E \to \mathrm{B} \mathcal{H})
                  of a Hilbert space
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
