            %p Maybe add a bit here about how NRep and Rep interact.
          %p
            The following are a few straightforward observations about the subcategories
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
